# Client-side routing (react-router's BrowserRouter, src/main.jsx) means
# every real route — /dashboard, /tasks/history, /staff/:id, etc. — only
# exists in JS. Without this, a direct link or refresh on any of them 404s
# on Cloudflare Pages; this falls back to index.html so the SPA can take
# over and resolve the route itself.
